    "body": "Hi @karel-3d, could you elaborate on what kind of application you were trying to build that required this sharing of information from the USB device? There is currently on going discussion on whether WebUSB should be implemented on shared workers, since shared workers could be deprecated. If you like, you could follow the discussion on the blink-dev Google group (https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/forum/#!topic/blink-dev/MReOVYgRpKk). Learning about the use cases for this feature could help in figuring out how to approach this problem. Thank you!",
